 "links": []}, {"id": "source-19", "field": "included", "text": "English speaking private tour guide.", "links": []}, {"id": "source-20", "field": "included", "text": "A well-maintained transportation including fuel.", "links": []}, {"id": "source-21", "field": "included", "text": "Unique experiences", "links": []}, {"id": "source-22", "field": "included", "text": "Local taxes.", "links": []}, {"id": "source-23", "field": "excluded", "text": "Admission fees to sites and places of interest", "links": []}, {"id": "source-24", "field": "excluded", "text": "Tips when appropriate", "links": []}, {"id": "source-25", "field": "excluded", "text": "Extras", "links": []}, {"id": "source-26", "field": "optional", "text": "Round trip ferry tickets", "links": []}, {"id": "source-27", "field": "optional", "text": "A camel ride experience by the sandy beach of the Atlantic", "links": []}, {"id": "source-28", "field": "optional", "text": "Lunch & drinks", "links": []}, {"id": "source-29", "field": "optional", "text": "Extra time", "links": []}, {"id": "source-30", "field": "before", "text": "The day trip to Tangier from Tarifa, Spain is not suitable for wheelchair users as the Medina (old town).", "links": []}, {"id": "source-31", "field": "before", "text": "We invite you to take a look at the top-rated day trip to Morocco from Spain or the Tangier guided walking tour .", "links": [{"text": "day trip to Morocco from Spain", "href": "https://www.tangierexcursions.com/day-trips/day-trip-to-morocco-from-spain/"}, {"text": "Tangier guided walking tour", "href": "https://www.tangierexcursions.com/day-trips/tangier-guided-walking-tour/"}]}, {"id": "source-32", "field": "before", "text": "Please note that once you submit your booking form, we will subsequently send you the confirmation file displaying further travel tips on how to get to Tangier by ferry from Tarifa along with your round trip ferry tickets (if you go with the option of buying the ferry tickets through us).", "links": []}, {"id": "source-33", "field": "before", "text": "Please note that your private tour guide will be waiting for you at the Tangier Ville port’s terminal holding a signboard with your name on it. In case you can’t find your guide, you might get approached by other fellow tour guides, as a result,  please try to avoid them and immediately reach out to us at +212 666-941294 and we will effectively remedy any issue.", "links": [{"text": "+212 666-941294", "href": "tel:+212666941294"}]}, {"id": "source-34", "field": "faqs", "text": "Morocco is the closest point to the African continent from Spain and Europe. The distance between Tangier (in the north of Morocco) and Tarifa (in the south of Spain) is around 15 kms (9.32 miles).", "links": []}, {"id": "source-35", "field": "faqs", "text": "How far is Morocco from Spain?", "links": []}, {"id": "source-36", "field": "faqs", "text": "Normally, it takes around an hour including the customs.", "links": []}, {"id": "source-37", "field": "faqs", "text": "How long is the ferry ride from Tarifa to Tangier?", "links": []}, {"id": "source-38", "field": "faqs", "text": "Since the foundation of Tangier Excursions LLC back in 2015, our commitment to offering, quality services while allowing our dear customers experience Tangier and Morocco intimately, has been always the same. Our aim can be attained through private tours..", "links": []}, {"id": "source-39", "field": "faqs", "text": "Do you offer shared tours?", "links": []}], "checks": {"overview": "MAPPED", "highlights": "MAPPED", "itinerary": "REVIEW REQUIRED", "included": "MAPPED", "map": "REVIEW REQUIRED", "cancellation": "REVIEW REQUIRED", "faqs": "REVIEW REQUIRED"}, "notes": {"itinerary": "Sequential mode: the source contains no confirmed stop times. Ferry tickets, camel ride and lunch are optional.", "map": "Approximate area coordinates are a proposed visualization, not verified meeting points or navigation directions.", "cancellation": "No cancellation policy exists in this tour